{"ref":"BDB, חֻפִּים²","hw":"חֻפִּים²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֻפִּים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> a son of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a> (𝔊 Οφιμ(ε)ιν, Οφμειν), descendant of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.15\">1 Ch 7:15</a> (𝔊 Αμφειν, Αφφειν, 𝔊L Οφερ), and so <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻפִם</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.15\">15</a>; v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חוּפָם\" href=\"/BDB,_חוּפָם\", dir=\"rtl\">חוּפָם</a>.","next":"BDB, חפף","prev":"BDB, חֻפָּה³"}